  "_comment": "Where scripts/fetch-extra.py gets each family listed here (families of manifest.json that are not listed are fetched whole from Google Fonts by scripts/fetch.mjs). google: Google Fonts CSS API; urls: one URL per style; zip: archive URL plus the member path of each style. subset: true keeps Basic Latin, Latin-1/Extended-A/B, Vietnamese, punctuation, currency, arrows, math and shapes (everything Indonesian and English documents use) to keep the repo small.",
